he direction she's facing and dash forward, dealing  (+215% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies on the path (counts as basic attack damage and is reduced to 50% against minions and creeps).\n\nBenedetta can only cast Swordout Slash when her Sword Intent is full and she is in the Swordout state.\n\nBenedetta also gains Sword Intent by dealing damage with her Basic Attacks and skills.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dec94d48625abe29337a7dc247ae4089.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":9710,"name":"Phantom Slash","description":"Benedetta withdraws swiftly and leaves a shadow in front. After a short delay, her shadow slashes forward in a fan-shaped area, dealing 200 (+75% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the enemies by 60% for 0.5s.\n\nMeanwhile, Benedetta dashes forward to slash, dealing 75 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. (If the target is hit by her shadow, damage caused by Benedetta herself will increase to 200%.)","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ae06e5db054c1b94fcc70b2158828fc6.png","video":null,"cd":10.0,"cost":55.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]},{"id":9720,"name":"An Eye for An Eye","description":"Benedetta raises her weapon to defend, gaining Control Immunity and blocking damage from any source for 0.8s. After this, she stabs in the designated direction, dealing 300 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage.\n\nIf Benedetta successfully fends off any damage while defending, she will gain full Sword Intent. If she fends off any control effects, her subsequent stab stuns the target for 1.5s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_22cec07aed8f5e783996cfc99fbbcaf3.png","video":null,"cd":15.0,"cost":100.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":9730,"name":"Alecto: Final Blow","description":"Benedetta clenches Alecto, dashes forward (Benedetta is untargetable during the dash), and performs a slash after a short delay, detonating the Sword Intent along the path. For 2.5s, the Sword Intent deals up to a total of 1560 (+1105% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within and slows them by 50%.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d9d895c9df7f13247a57660597045267.png","video":null,"cd":45.0,"cost":110.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Benedetta works well with strong CC initiators, like Johnson and Gatotkaca, because they allow her to maximize the effects of her Ultimate.","heroes":[{"id":32,"name":"Johnson","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_85ff988c6660b4d04f8dd3d40df988bb.png"},{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Benedetta's 2nd Skill can effectively block enemy CC, making her a great counter to heroes with predictable CC skills, such as Jawhead and Guinevere.","heroes":[{"id":54,"name":"Jawhead","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bd87c30b6c7de6ae3b5aa56162c48c8b.png"},{"id":80,"name":"Guinevere","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_901bdd5d4432a2c0290dfc71df615a5a.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Benedetta is countered by heroes with skills that shutdown mobility skills, such as Minsitthar and Phoveus, since all of Benedetta's skills are considered mobility.","heroes":[{"id":74,"name":"Minsitthar","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygam